
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Happy Birthday, Amepppp ⚽💚</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap');
:root{--g:#087443;--d:#06271d;--l:#b7e36b;--c:#f5f7ee}*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--c);background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%,#176c49,transparent 32%),linear-gradient(135deg,#061f18,#073d2b 55%,#0b5a3a);overflow-x:hidden}
body:before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.12;background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 48%,#c7edac 49%,transparent 50%);background-size:34px 34px;z-index:-1}
.screen{display:none;min-height:100vh;padding:78px 18px 35px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;animation:fade .65s}
.screen.active{display:flex}.card{width:min(100%,590px);padding:clamp(24px,5vw,42px);border:1px solid #b7e36b55;border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff12,#ffffff08);box-shadow:0 20px 70px #0005;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
h1,h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#f4ffd9;margin:12px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,49px)}h2{font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,34px)}p{line-height:1.8;color:#e1efdf}
.eyebrow{letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;color:var(--l);font-weight:700}
button{border:1px solid #d3f3a2;background:var(--l);color:#123b27;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:40px;font:700 14px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;margin:8px 4px;transition:.2s}button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 25px #0003}
button.ghost{background:transparent;color:#efffe5;border-color:#ffffff65}.brand{width:clamp(95px,24vw,145px);height:clamp(95px,24vw,145px);object-fit:contain;border-radius:50%;background:#087443;border:2px solid #d7f39b;padding:5px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0004}
.kicker{font-size:14px;color:#b7e36b}.ball{font-size:84px;display:block;animation:ball 2.2s infinite}.cup{font-size:45px}.name{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#c8ed8e}
.reveal{font-size:clamp(24px,6vw,34px);color:#d7f39b;font-weight:700;margin:20px 0}.cake{font-size:76px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block;animation:ball 2s infinite}.small{font-size:12px;color:#b6cbbb}
.wish{text-align:left;font-size:14px}.wish strong{color:#d7f39b}.finalpic{width:min(100%,330px);max-height:310px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #b7e36b80;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #0005}.moving{animation:drift 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.song-control{position:fixed;left:14px;bottom:14px;z-index:50;background:#062c20ef;border:1px solid #b7e36b90;border-radius:30px;padding:8px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px #0004}
.song-control button{margin:0;padding:9px 13px;font-size:12px}.song-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#e9f7d8;white-space:nowrap}.footer{font-size:12px;color:#b7d0bc;margin-top:20px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}@keyframes ball{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-5deg)}50%{transform:translateY(-10px) rotate(5deg)}}@keyframes drift{from{transform:translateX(-5px)}to{transform:translateX(5px)}}
@media(max-width:420px){.song-control{left:8px;bottom:8px}.song-label{font-size:10px}.screen{padding-top:68px}}
</style></head><body>
<audio id="song" src="birthday-song.mp3" preload="auto" loop></audio>
<div class="song-control"><span class="song-label">♪ PLAY THE SONG</span><button id="musicButton" onclick="toggleMusic()">▶ Play</button></div>
<section class="screen active" id="slide1"><div class="card"><img class="brand" src="images1.jpg" alt="Logo Persebaya"><p class="eyebrow">A little birthday surprise</p><h1>I have a little special gift for you</h1><p>For a guy who deserves a day as great as his favorite team. ⚽</p><button onclick="startSurprise()">Click Here →</button><p class="small">16 October 2026 · Keep this moment yours.</p></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="slide2"><div class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Match day energy</p><span class="ball">⚽</span><span class="cup">🏆</span><p class="name">My name is Mohamad Miftakhul</p><p>Ready for the birthday kick-off?</p><div id="birthdayReveal" hidden><div class="reveal">It's my happier day!! 💚</div><div class="cake" onclick="blowCandles()">🎂</div><p id="cakeMessage">18 candles. One big wish. ✨<br><span class="small">Tap the cake to blow out the candles.</span></p></div><button id="revealButton" onclick="revealBirthday()">Kick off the surprise ⚽</button><div id="nextArea" hidden><button onclick="goTo(3)">Click Here →</button></div></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="slide3"><div class="card"><img class="brand" src="images1.jpg" alt="Logo Persebaya Surabaya"><p class="eyebrow">One more year. More wins.</p><span class="ball">⚽🏆</span><h2 class="moving">Another year older, wiser, and still as awesome as ever. Have a blast today, man!</h2><h1>Happy birthday, amepppp </h1><div class="wish">Selamat bertambah umur yaa. Semoga kamu selalu sehat, bahagia, dilancarkan rezekinya, dan semua yang kamu inginkan bisa tercapai. Aku bersyukur bisa punya kamu di hidup aku. Kamu adalah orang yang paling aku sayang setelah papa mama kakak. Semoga kita bisa terus bersama, saling mengerti, dan saling mendukung dalam keadaan apa pun. Tetap jadi kamu yang aku kenal, yaa. <strong>Aku sayang kamu, selalu.</strong> 🤍💐</div><button onclick="goTo(4)">One last thing →</button></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="slide4"><div class="card"><p class="eyebrow">My favorite teammate</p><img class="finalpic" src="gendruwoo.png" alt="Two people together"><h2>May your favorite team win every match this season and your life be full of champion moments. ⚽🏆🔥</h2><p class="kicker">Keep winning, on and off the field.</p><h1>~isaaa~</h1><button onclick="goTo(1)" class="ghost">Back to the beginning ↺</button><p class="footer">Made for you, with love. 💚</p></div></section>
<script>
const song=document.getElementById('song'),musicButton=document.getElementById('musicButton');let candlesBlown=false;
async function playMusic(){try{await song.play();musicButton.textContent='Ⅱ Pause'}catch(e){musicButton.textContent='▶ Play'}}
function pauseMusic(){song.pause();musicButton.textContent='▶ Play'}
function toggleMusic(){song.paused?playMusic():pauseMusic()}
function startSurprise(){playMusic();goTo(2)}
function goTo(n){document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('active'));document.getElementById('slide'+n).classList.add('active');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
function revealBirthday(){document.getElementById('birthdayReveal').hidden=false;document.getElementById('revealButton').hidden=true;document.getElementById('nextArea').hidden=false}
function blowCandles(){const cake=document.querySelector('.cake'),msg=document.getElementById('cakeMessage');if(!candlesBlown){cake.textContent='🍰';msg.innerHTML='Whoosh! The candles are out. 🕯️💨<br>Make a wish, birthday boy! 💚';candlesBlown=true}else{cake.textContent='🎂';msg.innerHTML='18 candles. One big wish. ✨<br><span class="small">Tap the cake to blow out the candles.</span>';candlesBlown=false}}
song.addEventListener('play',()=>musicButton.textContent='Ⅱ Pause');song.addEventListener('pause',()=>musicButton.textContent='▶ Play');
</script></body></html>
